{"obsah":"<p>The end of the holidays was a bit hectic. We got to visit a few interesting festivals and town celebrations and coached several enthusiastic male and female bikers.</p>\n\n<p>Martin Šimůnek worked with Míra Brunclík at the village festival in Kvítkov and couldn't praise the local audience enough – after all, it was practically on their doorstep.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Vlasta, Tobík Dolák and Lukáš Valný, on the other hand, went to a festival in Kaplice, where unfortunately there was a bit of organisational noise. Simply put, plans work until they don't, and here it didn't work out. Anyway, after agreeing with the event organisers, a slot was found between bands where we could perform. To our credit, we drew the biggest crowd in front of the main stage of the whole afternoon.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>On the last day of the summer holidays Vlasta, Nikolka Kabeláčová and moto-trial rider Dalibor Šulc headed to the beer festival in Jevišovice, where in 33 degrees they rode a 40-minute exhibition followed by a workshop in the beautiful smallest town in South Moravia. It has to be said they have a really beautiful historic centre. We also coped with sloping terrain and made good use of our team sound system, since we operated as an independent unit. Thanks to everyone for the invitations – we look forward to the September events.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F09%2F457621207_818283947128475_1732195379830901694_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F09%2F457621207_818283947128475_1732195379830901694_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248789\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F09%2F458194980_818283880461815_5463164345209509728_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F09%2F458194980_818283880461815_5463164345209509728_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248787\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F09%2F457646018_818283783795158_3469440449815794554_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F09%2F457646018_818283783795158_3469440449815794554_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248790\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F09%2F457730347_818283697128500_8816864897759178084_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F09%2F457730347_818283697128500_8816864897759178084_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248791\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F09%2F457882163_818283590461844_273566033697388868_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F09%2F457882163_818283590461844_273566033697388868_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248788\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F09%2F